Error [E0121]: `item` was consumed by `the earlier consuming operation`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_escape_no_take.jet:12:10
    |
 12 |     sink(item)
    |          ^^^^
 Why: after a value moves to another name, the old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: give away a copy instead (`~item`) where it moved
move site: source bytes 176..208; reuse site: source bytes 218..222; consuming callee: the earlier consuming operation
